#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"To get information about a qubit's state, you can _measure_ it onto a [classical bit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Clbit). In Qiskit, measurements are performed in the computational basis, that is, the single-qubit Pauli-$Z$ basis. Therefore, a measurement yields 0 or 1, depending on the overlap with the Pauli-$Z$ eigenstates $|0\\rangle$ and $|1\\rangle$:\n"
msgstr ""
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
"Untuk mendapatkan maklumat tentang keadaan qubit, anda boleh _mengukurnya_ ke dalam [bit klasik](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Clbit). Dalam Qiskit, pengukuran dilakukan dalam asas pengiraan, iaitu asas Pauli-$Z$ satu-qubit. Oleh itu, pengukuran menghasilkan 0 atau 1, bergantung pada pertindihan dengan eigenstate Pauli-$Z$ $|0\\rangle$ dan $|1\\rangle$:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|q\\rangle \\xrightarrow{measure}\\begin{cases}\n"
"      0 (\\text{outcome}+1), \\text{with probability } p_0=|\\langle q|0\\rangle|^{2}\\text{,} \\\\\n"
"      1 (\\text{outcome}-1), \\text{with probability } p_1=|\\langle q|1\\rangle|^{2}\\text{.}\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|q\\rangle \\xrightarrow{measure}\\begin{cases}\n"
"      0 (\\text{outcome}+1), \\text{with probability } p_0=|\\langle q|0\\rangle|^{2}\\text{,} \\\\\n"
"      1 (\\text{outcome}-1), \\text{with probability } p_1=|\\langle q|1\\rangle|^{2}\\text{.}\n"
"    \\end{cases}\n"
"$$\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a measurement to a circuit {#apply-a-measurement-to-a-circuit}"
msgstr "Gunakan pengukuran pada Circuit {#apply-a-measurement-to-a-circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are several ways to apply measurements to a circuit:\n"
msgstr "Terdapat beberapa cara untuk menerapkan pengukuran pada Circuit:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QuantumCircuit.measure` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-method}"
msgstr "Kaedah `QuantumCircuit.measure` {#quantumcircuitmeasure-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure) method to measure a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#quantumcircuit-class).\n"
msgstr "Gunakan kaedah [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure) untuk mengukur [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#quantumcircuit-class).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Examples:\n"
msgstr "Contoh:\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "`Measure` class {#measure-class}"
msgstr "Kelas `Measure` {#measure-class}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Qiskit [Measure](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure) class measures the specified qubits.\n"
msgstr "Kelas [Measure](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure) Qiskit mengukur qubit yang dinyatakan.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QuantumCircuit.measure_all` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-all-method}"
msgstr "Kaedah `QuantumCircuit.measure_all` {#quantumcircuitmeasure-all-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To measure all qubits into the corresponding classical bits, use the [`measure_all`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all) method. By default, this method adds new classical bits in a `ClassicalRegister` to store these measurements.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengukur semua qubit ke dalam bit klasik yang sepadan, gunakan kaedah [`measure_all`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all). Secara lalai, kaedah ini menambah bit klasik baru dalam `ClassicalRegister` untuk menyimpan pengukuran ini.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QuantumCircuit.measure_active` method {#quantumcircuitmeasure-active-method}"
msgstr "Kaedah `QuantumCircuit.measure_active` {#quantumcircuitmeasure-active-method}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To measure all qubits that are not idle, use the [`measure_active`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_active) method. This method creates a new `ClassicalRegister` with a size equal to the number of non-idle qubits being measured.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengukur semua qubit yang tidak melahu, gunakan kaedah [`measure_active`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_active). Kaedah ini mencipta `ClassicalRegister` baru dengan saiz yang sama dengan bilangan qubit bukan-melahu yang diukur.\n"

